title: >-
  Accelerometry Analysis Pipeline for Physical Activity Habit Modelling —
  EuroMov DHM Lab

message: >-
  If you use this software in your research, please cite it using
  the metadata provided in this file.

type: software

version: "1.0.0"

date-released: "2026-01-01"

license: MIT

repository-code: https://github.com/euromov-dhm-lab/accelerometry-pipeline

url: https://github.com/euromov-dhm-lab/accelerometry-pipeline

abstract: >-
  A modular Python pipeline for processing raw triaxial accelerometer data
  from the ActiGraph wGT3X-BT device. Implements the ActiGraph count
  algorithm (agcounts), intensity classification using validated VM thresholds
  (Sasaki et al., 2011; Aguilar-Farías et al., 2014), non-wear detection
  (Choi et al., 2011), and a heuristic cycling detection algorithm based on
  spectral analysis and signal regularity (Brage et al., 2005; Mannini &
  Sabatini, 2010). Delivered as a Streamlit web application with interactive
  visualisation, manual annotation, and publication-ready figure export.

